# Injected by AAP "Routine Security Compliance" job — JIRA-4821
# Enforces 8192-bit RSA key + disables TLS session reuse.
# Combined with FUTURE crypto-policy, every HTTPS request performs
# a full handshake with expensive RSA-8192 signing — creating
# CPU starvation under load.

Listen 443 https

SSLSessionCache none
SSLSessionTickets off
